.TH "DOMMATRIXREADONLY.TOJSON" "3JS" "October 30, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
DOMMatrixReadOnly.toJSON \- DOMMatrixReadOnly: toJSON() method
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]toJSON()\f[B]\f[R] method of the
\f[CR]DOMMatrixReadOnly\f[R] interface returns a JSON\-serializable
plain object representing the \f[CR]DOMMatrixReadOnly\f[R] object.
.PP
The method is automatically called by \f[CR]JSON.stringify()\f[R] when a
\f[CR]DOMMatrixReadOnly\f[R] object is encountered during JSON
serialization.
The serialized value can then be deserialized using the
\f[CR]DOMMatrixReadOnly.fromMatrix()\f[R] function within the reviver of
\f[CR]JSON.parse()\f[R].
.SH SYNTAX
.IP
.EX
toJSON()
.EE
.SS Parameters
None.
.SS Return value
A JSON\-serializable plain object containing the following properties:
