{
  \(dqa\(dq: 1,
  \(dqb\(dq: 0,
  \(dqc\(dq: 0,
  \(dqd\(dq: 1,
  \(dqe\(dq: 20,
  \(dqf\(dq: 30,
  \(dqm11\(dq: 1,
  \(dqm12\(dq: 0,
  \(dqm13\(dq: 0,
  \(dqm14\(dq: 0,
  \(dqm21\(dq: 0,
  \(dqm22\(dq: 1,
  \(dqm23\(dq: 0,
  \(dqm24\(dq: 0,
  \(dqm31\(dq: 0,
  \(dqm32\(dq: 0,
  \(dqm33\(dq: 1,
  \(dqm34\(dq: 0,
  \(dqm41\(dq: 20,
  \(dqm42\(dq: 30,
  \(dqm43\(dq: 0,
  \(dqm44\(dq: 1,
  \(dqis2D\(dq: \f[B]true\f[R],
  \(dqisIdentity\(dq: \f[B]false\f[R]
}
.EE
.PP
The \f[CR]matrix3D\f[R] object is three\-dimensional, so it has
\f[CR]is2D\f[R] set to \f[CR]false\f[R]:
.IP
